# ── MPS Silks Store Operations Checklist ──────────────────────
# This app has NO server-side secrets in the repository.
#
# MPS_API_ENDPOINT  (PUBLIC) — the Google Apps Script web-app URL.
#   It is injected into dist/js/config.js at build time, or you can
#   paste it directly into js/config.js. A public endpoint is NOT
#   authentication: every action is authorised on the backend.
#
# Copy this file to .env for local use if you wish — .env is
# git-ignored and MUST NEVER contain PINs, service-account keys,
# spreadsheet IDs you consider private, or user data.
#
# Backend-only values (spreadsheet ID, Drive photo folder ID,
# session settings, PIN salt) are configured as Google Apps Script
# Script Properties — they never appear in this repository or in
# any browser. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
MPS_API_ENDPOINT=
